# 🧠 The big picture

You should now have this mental model:

```text
                     PYTHON
                        │
        ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
        ↓               ↓                ↓
   IDENTIFIERS      KEYWORDS         VALUES
        │               │                │
        ↓               ↓                ↓
      age             if              25
      name            for            "John"
      salary          def             5.5
        │
        ↓
